# Tool caches that land at the repository ROOT. vscode-extension/.gitignore
# already covers the extension's own tree, but a vitest/vite run started from
# here creates a bare `node_modules/.vite/` beside it, untracked and unignored
# — the same `git add -A` hazard the `.claude/` note below describes.
node_modules/

